### Feed as HTML
GET http://localhost:3000/
Accept: text/html

### Feed as JSON
GET http://localhost:3000/
Accept: application/json

### Next feed page (paste `next` from the response above)
GET http://localhost:3000/?before=PASTE_NEXT_HERE
Accept: application/json

### Feed as Markdown
GET http://localhost:3000/
Accept: text/markdown

### Profile as JSON
GET http://localhost:3000/lars/
Accept: application/json

### Profile as Markdown
GET http://localhost:3000/lars/
Accept: text/markdown

### Log in from fetch() (JSON in, JSON out, sets the cookie)
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "lars", "password": "correct-horse" }

### Blurt from fetch()
POST http://localhost:3000/api/blurts
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Hello from JSON" }

### Set your location from fetch() (snapped to a 1° cell)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/location
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lat": 59.91, "lon": 10.75 }

### Blurts near you as JSON
GET http://localhost:3000/near?radius=250
Accept: application/json
